  "releaseNotes": "- Fixed: **a search starting with periods no longer fails.** A query such as `... og noen` threw\n        an exception when a document's text began with periods too, as a book or film title with an\n        opening ellipsis does, so a search for that title failed instead of finding it. It now finds it.\n      - Changed: **a search of punctuation only is refused with a reason.** A query such as `..` or `...`\n        has no words to search for. `Search` now returns an empty result with `Reason` set, where it\n        used to search for the punctuation itself and, on some datasets, throw.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
